'''Shiny Pigs''' are mobs that spawn around the {{zone|Village}} during the [[Year of the Pig]]. They can be clicked on with {{Item|Shiny Orb}}s to receive various [[Shiny Orb#Loot|rewards]] after returning them to the orbs.

== Catching ==
Clicking a '''Shiny Pig''' while holding a {{Item|Shiny Orb}} launches the pig a short distance away while the orb hovers in place where it was used. The '''Shiny Pig''' must be returned to its associated orb by hitting it or making it walk there (it will walk away from the player who owns it). Once done, the '''Shiny Pig''' disappears and charges the orb, allowing it to be clicked for a reward. Only the player that used the orb may claim a prize from it.

A '''Shiny Pig''' that goes {{Green|90}} seconds without returning to its associated {{Item|Shiny Orb}} will despawn alongside the orb without giving any loot. The {{Item|Shiny Orb}} will not be refunded.

A single player may own up to {{Green|2}} '''Shiny Pigs''' at once, but each will only charge the specific {{Item|Shiny Orb}} they were clicked with.

