== Tips ==
* It's recommended to use the {{EnchantmentsLink|Knockback}} [[Enchantments|Enchantment]] or a {{Item|Shiny Rod}} to lead '''Shiny Pigs''' to {{Item|Shiny Orb}}s more effectively.
** Alternatively, the player can use a high {{Stat|Attack Speed}} weapon, such as a {{Item|Zombie Soldier Cutlass}}, to allow themselves to hit the '''Shiny Pig''' farther.
* It is also possible to use [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7t0PyqYsac8 Knockback Displacement] to redirect '''Shiny Pigs''', though quite difficult.

== Bugs ==
* '''Shiny Pigs''' can occasionally phase through blocks and fly to sections of the map that are unreachable when clicked with a {{Item|Shiny Orb}}.
* The two side arrows from the {{Item|Runaan's Bow}} target '''Shiny Pigs'''.<!--Is this still true?-->

== Trivia ==
* When '''Shiny Pigs''' were first added, they were able to be killed with the {{Item|Aspect of the Dragons}}'s ability.

